    {
      "Name": "Expedition",
      "OriginalAuthor": "MrOne",
      "Forks": [
        {
          "Author": "MrOneD",
          "Location": "danthespal",
          "Name": "Expedition",
          "LatestCommit": {
            "Message": "Add Expedition route weights guide\n\nThis document provides a comprehensive guide on how the Expedition route planner scores targets, detailing scoring methods, priorities, base weights, and practical profiles for players configuring the plugin.",
            "Hash": "4b01d1b00a7199744d610a65ca68f05b041cec69",
            "Author": "danthespal",
            "Date": "2026-09-18T10:52:56Z"
          },
          "Releases": [
            {
              "Id": "0.6.0",
              "Title": "Expedition 0.6.0",
              "FilesAttached": [
                "Expedition.zip"
              ],
              "Description": "",
              "Date": "2026-09-18T10:52:56Z"
            },
            {
              "Id": "0.5.0",
              "Title": "Expedition 0.5.0",
              "FilesAttached": [
                "Expedition.zip"
              ],
              "Description": "## Added\r\n- Added a live Expedition control window with plan/clear actions, route strategy selection, detonator state, blast radius, fuse length, explosive count, and remnant count.\r\n- Added configurable plan and clear-route hotkeys.\r\n- Added route planning with terrain clearance, fuse-length constraints, route refinement, target anchoring, placed-explosive progress, and off-route detection.\r\n- Added named strategy files under config/strategies/, including Balanced, Remnants, Juiced, Fast, and Logbooks presets.\r\n- Added configurable route priorities and exalted-orb base weights for:- Runic Remnant rewards.\r\n-- Remnant monster waves.\r\n-- Chests and caverns.\r\n-- Runic monster markers.\r\n-- Marker categories and minimap icons.\r\n-- Propagating rune effects.\r\n- Added Runic Remnant price evaluation using compatible/selected rune-forge recipes.\r\n- Added price labels in the world, Large Map, minimap, and Runeshape reward panel.\r\n- Added Expedition research notes and the new user documentation.\r\n## Changed\r\n- Replaced the former map helper with the new route-planning flow.\r\n- Uses the live game-provided blast radius and fuse data instead of manual estimates.\r\n- Uses terrain-aware grid positions and entity-specific blast-radius bonuses.\r\n- Prevents caverns and remnants from being unearthed by the same explosion.\r\n- Clears route and price state when disabled or when the area changes.\r\n## Fixes\r\n- Fixed stale route/price state surviving disable and re-enable.\r\n- Fixed Large Map Runic Remnant price labels being hidden behind Radar\u2019s Expedition2Encounter icon by rendering those labels on the foreground layer.\r\n- Added bounds to controller/listener reads to avoid oversized corrupted game containers causing excessive allocations.",
              "Date": "2026-09-18T10:14:41Z"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "Description": "",
      "EndorsedAuthor": "danthespal"
    },
